UByte Interactive"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"31 Jul, 2024"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cAfter playing and replaying a few times, I found a game that demonstrates maturity in its design choices and mechanics. In its current development stage, I found very conscious decisions of what the game wants to be.  Naturally, there is still much to be done and improved, but MARS 2120 has great potential. The basic structures of a good metroidvania are all here, competently implemented.\u201d<br>Game Lodge<br><br>\u201cIn simple terms, Mars is the Brazilian Super Metroid, capable of reproducing the qualities of the Nintendo franchise very well, especially in its aesthetics and setting, which complement each other optimally, building the idea of mystery that leads players to continue exploring to understand what is happening - this atmosphere of mystery, in fact, is reminiscent of Metroid Dread.\u201d<br>O MEGASCOPIO<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/ss_1dbeaa5195a063a9dc3dac3cd8e7ac818ca5c326.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759866344","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/ss_1dbeaa5195a063a9dc3dac3cd8e7ac818ca5c326.600x338.jpg?t=1759866344"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/ss_2e0c52f879c268fb0228f450a8fe907ebd9657b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759866344","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/ss_2e0c52f879c268fb0228f450a8fe907ebd9657b1.600x338.jpg?t=1759866344"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic